# PAPERLY
## A Beautiful, Fully Offline Android Document Workspace

Build a complete, production-quality native Android application named **Paperly**, using Kotlin and Jetpack Compose.

Paperly is an offline-first document viewing, reading, conversion, compression, image processing and document organisation application.

It combines four major product categories into one cohesive application:

1. A professional PDF reader.
2. A lightweight Excel and spreadsheet viewer.
3. An image-processing and conversion workshop.
4. A comprehensive PDF manipulation workshop.

Its defining characteristic is an extensive visual customisation system with 250+ distinct theme presets and a complete theme editor.

The application must be lightweight, responsive, dependable, aesthetically sophisticated and fully functional without internet connectivity.

This is not a cloud document platform, subscription-based productivity suite or generic file manager.

**Paperly should feel like a complete document workspace that users can comfortably keep installed as their everyday document utility.**

