# 1. CORE PRODUCT PHILOSOPHY

The application should solve common document-related problems without requiring users to install several separate applications.

Users should be able to:

- Open and read PDFs.
- View Excel spreadsheets.
- Search within documents.
- Resize photographs.
- Compress images to specific file sizes.
- Convert between image formats.
- Merge PDF documents.
- Split PDFs.
- Reorganise document pages.
- Extract selected pages.
- Generate PDFs from photographs.
- Add basic annotations.
- Share documents.
- Customise the entire application's appearance.

The application must prioritise:

- Simplicity.
- Reliability.
- Offline functionality.
- Local processing.
- Performance.
- Non-destructive operations.
- Excellent readability.
- Extensive visual personalisation.

Do not turn Paperly into an unnecessarily complicated productivity system.

