## GitHub Actions Build Support

Include a GitHub Actions workflow at:

`.github/workflows/build-apk.yml`

The workflow should:

1. Check out the source code.
2. Set up the compatible JDK.
3. Install required Android SDK components.
4. Use the committed Gradle wrapper.
5. Build the debug APK.
6. Upload the generated APK as a downloadable GitHub Actions artifact.

Include an optional release-build workflow that supports user-supplied signing credentials through GitHub Actions Secrets.

Never commit signing keys or passwords.

The workflow should support manual execution through `workflow_dispatch`.

Document how to download the generated APK from GitHub Actions.

The debug build must remain suitable for local testing and independent distribution as an early preview.

